<title>USA: State Bancorp Q1 shr $0.34 vs $0.31.</title>
<headline>State Bancorp Q1 shr $0.34 vs $0.31.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HYDE PARK, N.Y. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.34		    $0.31</p>
<p> Net		 1,714		    1,428</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,028,292		4,557,880</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said the total assets for the first quarter of 1997 was $626.5 million versus $581.9 for the same period the year before.</p>
<p>The company said the provision for credit losses was $450,000 versus $375,000.</p>
